      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "4a. Deep niche continuity & deliberate cross-fertilization (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "Owner directives, 2026-11-28: *\"updates skills: if you have queue of research agents, generally keep them researching deep into niche topic areas. so related questions go to same agent. occasionally, if hints of cross-fertilization, ask questions of multiple agents to see if connections can be made\"*, and *\"research agents need to also use evidence gathering skills and process (may need to add this / update this in KG) when researching a topic... write up topic areas of research, for each, develop a short list of papers, data etc needed, retrieve and ingest into KG, assess for relevancy. also make use of other databases that agent or user may have access to google scholar, DOI, arxiv, pubmed, etc... this should be a part of document authoring. provenance of paper recorded as part of notes in authoring process and linked in paper as relevant\"*.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
